<title>USA: Health Risk wins software patents.</title>
<headline>Health Risk wins software patents.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Health Risk Management Inc and its Institute for Healthcare Quality subsidiary said Monday they had received patents from the United States and New Zealand for the company's QualityFIRST guidelines software.</p>
<p>The company said the software helps health care managers and doctors make and document clinical decisions, including diagnosing ailments, selecting treatments and managing resources.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
